WEBVTT

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:01.856
That they really do belong
in every educator's toolkit.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:05.216
There's no good reason
to keep comic books and graphic novels

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.296
out of K-12 education.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.976
They teach visually,

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.760
they give our students
that remote control.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.216
The educational potential is there

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.976
just waiting to be tapped

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.680
by creative people like you.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.656
Thank you.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.760
(Applause)